    "updated_at": "2026-11-14T09:24:43Z",
    "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on main `3ead1295b` (run 43577677785, 2026-11-14 09:14Z).\nOnly one test failed: `a_lowered_cap_refuses_the_same_face_at_once` in `import_step_guard`.\nThe message is the known one: \"import did not finish within 30s\" (`crates/app/tests/import_step_guard.rs:36`).\nEvery other suite passed, and clippy passed.\nThis lane did not open a \"main is red (post-merge gate)\" issue. That label is for broken\nmain. This failure matches this open issue instead.\nA confirmation run of `post-merge.yml` on the same head is dispatched. If it is green,\nthe tree is sound and this remains a flake. If it fails the same way again, the timeout\nis real and this issue needs a look at the import time, not the runner load.\n",
